## SECURITY BEST PRACTICES

1. Never expose service role keys - Use anon key + RLS in frontend
2. Validate all inputs - Use Zod schemas on API routes
3. Sanitize user content - Escape HTML in chat messages
4. Rate limit API routes - Prevent abuse with Vercel rate limiting
5. Use HTTPS only - Enforce in production
6. Implement CSRF protection - Built into Next.js forms
7. Audit dependencies - Run npm audit regularly

