## COMMON ISSUES & SOLUTIONS

Issue: "Hydration mismatch"
Solution: Ensure Server and Client Components render same initial HTML. Use suppressHydrationWarning on time-sensitive elements.

Issue: Supabase RLS blocking queries
Solution: Check policies with EXPLAIN in SQL editor. Ensure auth.uid() matches expected user.

Issue: Vapi voice not working
Solution: Verify microphone permissions. Check browser console for CORS errors. Ensure HTTPS in production.

Issue: Claude API timeout
Solution: Increase max_tokens or implement streaming. Add retry logic with exponential backoff.

